From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Maxim Stepanov <g.maxim.stepanoff@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 9 Jul 2026 23:39:08 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] agent_settings, ui: add animation settings and shared
 animation helpers

- agent.mascot (bool, default true) and agent.animations
  (full | reduced | off, default full) settings
- ui::with_delay / ui::stagger_delay easing helpers for staggered
  entrances (gpui Animation has no built-in delay)
- ui::CrossFade component: 120ms opposing-opacity swap between two
  stacked elements
